  "id": "choose-the-bear",
  "title": "Choose The Bear",
  "subtitle": "A Speculative Revision of the Myth of Callisto",
  "description": "From the incredibly inventive mind of Aly Kantor (reANIMA) in concert with the production value and team of Broken Arts Entertainment comes a sci-fi story that deserves your attention. CHOOSE THE BEAR is a near-future sci-fi drama reimagining the myth of Callisto amid an accelerating climate collapse. As Earth’s resources vanish, the wealthy escape to Zenith Aerospace’s exclusive orbital “Communities,” marketed as humanity’s sustainable future. When Zenith launches the Arcadia Project, disgraced Coast Guard aviator Callie Winter is hired as its off-world auditor—unaware she’s also a valuable test subject in a secret race to solve human reproduction in space. On Earth, engineer Diana Aimes becomes Callie’s sole lifeline. As trust and intimacy grow between them, Zenith exploits that bond, forcing both women to confront consent, autonomy, and the true cost of survival in a manufactured utopia.",
